{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026GQaZ05B87i1795219857.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>荃灣有住宅單位在清晨起火，約100人疏散，一名男子吸入濃煙不適送院。</p><p></p><p>消防出動一條喉，及一隊煙帽隊撲救，約半小時後將火救熄。約100名居民自行疏散到地面，警員在場協助。</p><p></p><p>警方指，事發在清晨約5時，青山公路荃灣段623號韻濤居低層一個單位起火，初步調查起火原因，懷疑是暖爐引燃被鋪或床褥所致。單位內一名三十多歲男子吸入濃煙不適，送往仁濟醫院治理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T01:03:52.285036+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T00:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T04:16:20.421536+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T00:57:15.257990+00:00","content_hash":"8484ebd819458afc5fac74c356ad3de1fe5ee6272bd5adabd4c98f5ca45a6214","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T01:03:52.285036+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}